# SCENE · connect to the Robotics bench the way a player does: a Computer is FOUND, never bought (§19),
# so take the one the sea gave you, grow a Matrixtank with it, and go home.
# A new tank switches you into it. A journey plays as a player, so the one find it cannot fish on
# cue is handed over in debug mode, which is switched straight back off.

run !debugmode
run /give computer
run !debugmode
run /consume computer
expect Name your
snap the Computer names the tank it grows
type Zion
key enter
run /switch "Fishtank"
absent Zion
